|---|---|---|---|
| real work: input | 150 | 0.4% | fresh prompt tokens, full price |
| real work: output | 2,200 | 5.8% | generated tokens — the most expensive kind |
| cache write | 1,900 | 5.0% | context stored for reuse (~1.25× input price) |
